# New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/blackmaw-hold (level range is Blizzard's). The page lists
# 5 Horde quests, takeable from level 45-55, without their givers.
@dungeon Blackmaw Hold
@levels 55-60
@window 53-60
@best 56
@hub Azshara, 22.0, 52.0, 12
@hub Orgrimmar, 50.0, 50.0
@entrance none
RUN | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is a furbolg city behind the big gate in Azshara. It has 5 Horde quests, but who gives them is not published yet: ask around Valormok and take what is offered; the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
